{{Quote|A legendary trident, forged for the [[Cake Prince|prince of dough]].|Item}}
The '''Spikey Trident''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Spikey Trident is well known for its unique ability to pull enemies back towards the player (alongside [[Trident]]) allowing for easy extension off of otherwise hard to extend moves, such as [[Godhuman]] [C], [[Spirit]] [V] and [[Sanguine Art]]'s [Z]. Surprisingly, both moves of Spikey trident can damage [[Sea Beast|Sea Beasts]] despite being single target. 

It however is also infamous for being very easy to counter through basic knowledge of [[Instinct]].

* The [[Cyborg]] race however, may alleviate this issue to an extent.

==Obtainment==
The Spikey Trident can be obtained with a 10% chance from the [[Cake Prince]] or with a higher chance from the [[Dough King]].

